  data: {
    LLM: "All 40 cards dealt singly; last card exposed for trump. Player to dealer's right leads; follow suit and beat or trump per Tute rules. After winning a trick, a player may sing 40 (king-horse of trumps) or 20 (king-horse of another suit). Last trick winner may take or decline 10 extra points. Count points individually; most points loses, or 101+ wins.",
    Player: "All 40 cards dealt singly; last card exposed for trump. Player to dealer's right leads; follow suit and beat or trump per Tute rules. After winning a trick, a player may sing 40 (king-horse of trumps) or 20 (king-horse of another suit). Last trick winner may take or decline 10 extra points. Count points individually; most points loses, or 101+ wins.",
    objective: 'Avoid taking the most points; or reach 101 or more points to win and make all others lose. The player with the most points (under 101) loses unless someone reaches 101+.',
    gameplay: "All 40 cards dealt singly; last card exposed for trump. Player to dealer's right leads; follow suit and beat or trump per Tute rules. After winning a trick, a player may sing 40 (king-horse of trumps) or 20 (king-horse of another suit). Last trick winner may take or decline 10 extra points. Count points individually; most points loses, or 101+ wins.",
    keyRules: [
